  "key_realignments": [
    "Application orchestration belongs in ferric-browser-application, not a new BrowserUi-owned policy system.",
    "Main.qml is composition only; ephemeral token handling now has FerricWindowRegistryController.qml.",
    "Session schema 2 stays safe-recovery-only; explicit captures use a new schema.",
    "Dirty-state suspension is refused today; explicit live preservation needs separate intent and native qualification.",
    "Window/profile affinity remains intact; initial isolated child appears in its own native window.",
    "ADR-0014 explicit scroll-target identity remains document-local and is not persisted.",
    "Cookie source completeness, partition identity and atomic apply are not fabricated from observer revisions."
